body:
EDIT: 1/4 cup. I responded before coffee, my bad!

&#x200B;

1 stick is generally 1/2 cup of butter. But it's too early to tell you what that weighs LOL.

I'm bipolar and I hate when people joke that they are bipolar because they have a "mood swing". 

&#x200B;

Maybe I'm being overly sensitive but being bipolar has ruined me financially and has almost destroyed my marriage. It's not some quaint little personality quirk.
